{
  "id": "LUK.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgeng'wa kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Yesu wīnga ī Yolodani okajiwe na Moyo Ng'wela; h'ūyo ūntongeela kūja kū matogolo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūūkamala ko shikū makūmi ane, akūgemagwa na Shetani. Ū mu shikū jenījo atalyile shose shose; aho jashila ūtuuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo, ū Shetani ūng'wīla, “Ūlū ūlī Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu līlagīlage ī liwe īlī lībize shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūnshokeja, “Yandīkilwe gīkī, ‘Ū munhū atūdūla kūbiza mpanga kūlwa shilīwa dūhū.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ū Shetani ūntongeela kūlinha kwigūlya, ūūkang'oolekeja pye a mabūsugi ga mu sī ng'wikanza ido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla gīkī, “Nakūkwinha bebe pyī ū būdūla wenūbū nī likūjo lyamo, nguno namala kwinhwa nene, nadūgije kūng'winha ose ose ūyo nūtogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū bebe ūlū ūnilamya, shikūbiza shako pye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Gwandīkilwe gīkī, ‘Namyage Seeba Mulungu wako, na ūntūmamīle wei dūhū!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūntongeela kūja Yelusalemu, ūūkantūūla higūlya ya hekalu; ūng'wīla, “Ūlū ūlī Ng'wana o ng'wa Mulungu iponejage ha sī kūfuma aha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gwandīkilwe gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Gūhayiwe gīkī, ‘Yaya ū kūngema ū Seeba Mulungu wako.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shetani aho wamala pyī ū būgemi, ūneka kakanza ho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu wandya nīmo mu Galilaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūshoka ī Galilaya alī mu būdūla bo ng'wa Moyo; ū lūkumo lokwe lūsambaala pye a mapandī genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūnkumīlīja pye a banhū ūlū olanga ū mu masinagogi gabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kūleng'wa mu nzengo go ng'wawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūshika nī Nazaleti ūko walī wakūlīla; a ha lūshikū lo sabato wingīla ū ng'wisinagogi gīt'ūmo wītīlaga na kale, wīmīīla kūsoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna winhwa shitabo sha ng'hangi Isaya, ūshikundūla ūkooba ipandī aho handīkilwe gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Moyo wa ng'wa Seeba alī hamò nū nene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūshikundīkīja ī shitabo ūng'winhīlīja ū ntūmami; ū wei wigasha. Pye abo baalīmo ū ng'wisinagogi būnkalalīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Lelo ī shandīkwa īshi shashikīlījiwa mudegelekile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye būyūng'haya chiza bakwīkumyaga ī mihayo īyo yafumaga ū mu nomo gokwe; būyiwīla gīkī, “Bing'we ū ng'wenūyū atī ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yosefu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Namanile ng'wigeleelagwa na kūniwīla lūsumo lwa gīkī, ‘Bebe mfumu, angū ū zūnzū atinunaga; al'ilagūlage bebe ng'wenekīlī shi. Īyo twigwile gīkī olūyītaga Kapelanaumu, yītage nū mu nzengo gwa ng'wing'we ūmu!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla, “Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, atīho ng'hangi ūyo akanukūlagwa mu nzengo go ng'wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī baalīho bachīlwa bingī ū mu Isiraeli ū mu shikū ja ng'wa Eliya, aho ilunde līkalugalwa myaka idatū na myeji ītandatū, yūgwa nzala nhaale hose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Eliya atatūmilwe nūūlū kūlī ūmò wabo, ūlū ītī kūlī nchīlwa o Saleputa, mu sī ya Sidoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nū mu shikū ja ng'hangi Elisha, baalīmo bingī a ba mbiji ū mu Isiraeli, alīyo ateejiwe nūūlū ūmò wabo, ūlū atī Naamani muna Sulia dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bīyigwa ī yenīyo, pye abo baalīmo ū ng'wisinagogi būpelana no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbūūka, būmfunya hanze ya nzengo, būja nang'hwe kū lūgegu lo h'ing'ong'ho aho golī gūzengelilwe ū nzengo gwabo, gīkī bakanshindīke witaalīke ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei ūbīta ha gatī gatī yabo, ūbīngīla, ūja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa munhū w'isamva",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūtulumenha ajile, ūūkashika Kapelanaumu, nzengo gūmò gwaho gwa mu Galilaya; a ha sabato ūbalanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūbūkumya ū būlangi bokwe, nguno ū mhayo gwakwe gwalī na būdūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wisinagogi ng'wenūmo walīmo na munhū wa moyo nsoso gw'isamva; wandya kūlīla n'ilaka lya higūlya alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yesu wa Nazaleti, gūlīho mhayo kī a ha gatī yise nū bebe? Wizaga kūtūyagaja? Nakūmanile ūlī nani ū bebe, ūlī Ng'wela wa ng'wa Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūlīhama alīhaya, “Huumūlaga nīyo ūmfume!” Ī lisamva lyūngalagaja haho gatī gatī, lyūmfuma ng'hana, lyūneka lītaaminije nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye būjinjimala, bandya kwiwīla boi benekīlī na benekīlī gīkī, “Mhayo kī nago ū gwenūyū hangī? Na a masamva alīyūgahama bo nguzu gafuma!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū lūkumo lokwe lūsambaala pye a hose ū mu mapandī ayo gaalī gabīmbīghanilwe nalyo ī lipandī lyenīlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa banhū bingī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbūūka wīnga ū ng'wisinagogi ūūkingīla mu numba ya ng'wa Simoni. Nina būkwi wa ng'wa Simoni walī mu ndīlī adadīlilwe nswiza nkalī, būng'wīla ū Yesu ī mhola jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wegeela, wīmīīla hihī nang'hwe, ūgūhama ū nswiza gūnekela; haho na haho ūbūūka ūbabeegeja shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyayūjīlīīla kūgwa ī līīmi, bandya kūng'wenhela pye abo baalī na būsaatu bo mbika na mbika. Būlī ng'wene ūyo ontūūlīlaga makono opīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū bingī gakayūbafuma masamva kūnū galīlīla gūhaya, “Ū bebe ūlī Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu!” Gwike ū wei wagahamaga, wagalemeja ū kūyomba, nguno gaalī gandeebile gīkī Kilisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūgendo lwa kūja akūlomeelaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wela ī dilū, ūfuma ūja hanhū iyene, a mabita ga banhū gandya kūnkooba, nose būmpandīka būnemeja atizīnga akabaleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Shinigeleelilwe naje na kū mizengo yīngī, nū kwene nakajilomeele ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu; nguno natūmilwe kūlwa mhayo gwenūyū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūja akūlomeelaga mu masinagogi ga mu sī ya Būyudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
